                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Hitman GO: Definitive Edition is a good game, but definitely a different experience from the usual Hitman games. Instead of sneaking around in large environments and taking out targets however you want, it uses a turn-based puzzle format where every move matters. It takes a little getting used to, but once you understand how it works, it becomes surprisingly enjoyable.\r\n\r\nI liked how the game makes you think ahead and plan your moves carefully. Each level feels like a little puzzle where you need to figure out the best way to reach your target without getting caught. The board-game style also gives it a unique look that works really well with the gameplay.\r\n\r\nOverall, it's a refreshing spin-off that does something different with the Hitman formula. It won't replace the main games, but it's still a fun experience in its own right. If you're open to trying something different from the usual stealth action, I'd definitely recommend it.",
                        "timestamp_created": 1792164051,
